  "caveats": [
    "Moderate rather than Strong: the rule needs at least two cohorts, three treated states and a smallest detectable effect within 5; this design has 1 cohort, 7 treated states and a smallest detectable effect of 6.0.",
    "Confounder scan (not pre-registered; docs/confounder_scan.md): no other register change of high or medium relevance. Timing: no treated series moved most away from the reform period.",
    "Re-evaluation: the earlier results were known when this specification was written; the estimator layers were fixed beforehand by the blinded power study."
  ],
